@Ariva.Api.Ingest_HostAddress = http://localhost:51002

### Startup probe
GET {{Ariva.Api.Ingest_HostAddress}}/health/startup
Accept: application/json

### Readiness probe
GET {{Ariva.Api.Ingest_HostAddress}}/health/readiness
Accept: application/json

### Liveness probe
GET {{Ariva.Api.Ingest_HostAddress}}/health/liveness
Accept: application/json

### Who Ariva thinks this device is, with the server clock (device credential; ARV-022)
GET {{Ariva.Api.Ingest_HostAddress}}/api/v1/ingest/device
X-Ariva-Device-Key: {{deviceKey}}

### The published zones and lines of the device's own queue zone (another zone answers 403)
GET {{Ariva.Api.Ingest_HostAddress}}/api/v1/ingest/zones/A-VIS
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceKey}}
